  "purpose": "pull is the bias the Player sets on an input as it requests the line: an object keyed by the decimal pin string, each value up, down or none, every key a pin in pins. A pin without an entry, and every pin when pull is absent, is none: the Player sets no bias. Line 17 has nothing connected and would read low; with a pull up it reads high, which is how a button wired to ground is read. A host that advertises device.gpio.pull accepts pull.",
